OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATighter rules planned to protect people
OL,4,Afrom cosmetic surgery that goes badly
OL,5,Awrong
OL,6,
OL,7,FOnly properly trained professionals
OL,8,Fwill be allowed to offer high-risk
OL,9,Fcosmetic procedures like liquid
OL,10,FBrazilian butt lifts (BBLs), vampire
OL,11,Ffacials and chemical peels, under
OL,12,Flong-awaited government plans for
OL,13,FEngland in 2027.
OL,15,FThe government said it wanted to "drive
OL,16,Fcosmetic cowboys out of the market" and
OL,17,Fshield people from treatments "that can
OL,18,Fgo badly wrong".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
