OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATighter rules planned to protect people
OL,4,Afrom cosmetic surgery that goes badly
OL,5,Awrong
OL,6,
OL,7,FCurrently, there are no restrictions
OL,8,Fover who can carry out these 'no
OL,9,Fscalpel' procedures, which can harm or
OL,10,Fkill if not performed safely.
OL,12,FUnder the new rules, high-risk
OL,13,Fprocedures for under-18s will also be
OL,14,Fbanned, and rogue providers will face
OL,15,Fnew criminal offences and fixed fines
OL,16,Fof up to #4,000.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
